REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_NSDHL — NSDHL sterol-C4-decarboxylase after SC4MOL on BA continuum
# Continuum ...->pcca->mcee->mut->suclg1->sdha->fh->mdh->cs->aco2->idh2->ogdh->scs->dld->dlst->oxct1->acat1->hmgcs2->hmgcl->bdh1->slc16a1->slc16a7->emb->aacs->hmgcs1->hmgcr->mvk->pmvk->mvd->idi1->fdps->sqs->sqle->lss->cyp51->tm7sf2->sc4mol->nsdhl (NSDHL after SC4MOL)
# Gift: NSDHL opens C4-oxygenated demethylation intermediate -> 4alpha-methyl-cholesta-8,24-dien-3-one decarboxylation gate under ASSERT after SC4MOL open.
# Domain: post-SC4MOL sterol-C4-decarboxylase (NSDHL/ERG26) C4-carboxyl decarboxylation gate.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY mito OF Cell 1 44 0
ENTITY peri OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY ash OF Cell 0 18 0
ENTITY starve OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY nest OF Cell 1 52 0

SEND mito set_threshold 10
